        <mxCell id="JsonFileNode" value="&lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;file&amp;gt;&amp;gt;  bank_data.json&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;UTF-8, indented. A &quot;$type&quot; discriminator is written per User&lt;br&gt;(customer | staff) and per Account (everyday | investment | omni).&lt;br&gt;Replaced atomically via bank_data.json.tmp; an unreadable file is&lt;br&gt;quarantined as bank_data.json.corrupt-&amp;lt;timestamp&amp;gt;." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#F5F5F5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
